1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:05,000
(Howard:)Anyway, sir,
l need to talk to you about something.

2
00:00:05,211 --> 00:00:06,671
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Walnut?

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:09,720
(Howard:)No, thank you. I'm allergic.

4
00:00:09,924 --> 00:00:15,224
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Oh, sure. My partner used to have that.
He's dead now.

5
00:00:16,889 --> 00:00:19,979
- From nuts, heh?
- No, his wife shot him.

6
00:00:21,227 --> 00:00:24,727
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)But she was nuts. So in a way...

7
00:00:26,024 --> 00:00:28,864
(Howard:)Nice story. Anyway...

8
00:00:29,068 --> 00:00:31,278
(Howard:)...the reason
l wanted to talk to you is...

9
00:00:31,487 --> 00:00:36,237
(Howard:)...NASA has moved up my launch
to the lnternational Space Station.

10
00:00:36,451 --> 00:00:40,291
- Yeah, so?
- So the date is going to conflict...

11
00:00:40,496 --> 00:00:43,956
(Howard:)...with me marrying your daughter.
Now, I know what you're going to say.

12
00:00:44,167 --> 00:00:46,757
l made a commitment to Bernadette
and to your family...

13
00:00:46,961 --> 00:00:50,761
...and l've got a lot of nerve coming here
and demanding that we postpone this.

14
00:00:50,965 --> 00:00:54,175
(Howard:)Well, message heard and understood.
Mission cancelled. Thank you.

15
00:00:56,012 --> 00:00:57,392
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Where are you going?

16
00:00:57,597 --> 00:00:58,807
(Leonard:)I'm sorry.

17
00:00:59,015 --> 00:01:01,225
(Howard:)May I be excused?

